      en: ["The Citadel of Besançon was constructed between 1668 and 1683.", "Writer Victor Hugo was born in the city on February 26, 1802.", "The Vauban fortifications were designated a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2008.", "The city features an astronomical clock from 1860 containing 30,000 parts.", "The University of Franche-Comté was established in Besançon in 1423.", "The Lumière brothers were born here: Auguste in 1862 and Louis in 1864."],
