      en: ["Amiens Cathedral has an interior volume of 200,000 m³.", "Jules Verne lived in Amiens from 1871 until his death in 1905.", "The Hortillonnages feature 65 kilometers of navigable waterways.", "The Tour Perret was the tallest building in Europe when completed in 1952.", "The Battle of the Somme took place in 1916 in the city's immediate vicinity.", "The cathedral was added to the UNESCO World Heritage list in 1981."],
