      en: ["Victor Hugo, the famous writer, was born in Besançon in 1802.", "The Planoise district in Besançon-Ouest was built starting in 1962 as a major modern housing project.", "The Vauban Citadel was added to the UNESCO World Heritage list in 2008.", "Besançon has been regarded as the center of the French watchmaking industry since the 18th century.", "The University Hospital in Besançon-Ouest is one of the region's largest employers.", "The Doubs river flows around the historical center in an almost complete loop."],
